1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Hans Strang''', ryttmästaren vid Upplandsfanan 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med '''Carin Bagge av Berga''', (trolovad före 1588-12-29).
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bagge_af_Berga_nr_118#TAB_10
2 CONT * Riksregistraturet  https://sok.riksarkivet.se/
2 CONT
2 CONT A possible nephew to Hans,  Alexander Strang, (son of David), late provost of Forfar, (Fharfair). D. aft. 9 May 1665. Thereof if true, his parents would be Alexander Strang and Elsbeth Williamsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The father of sisters Katarina and Alitz Stång is uncertain. His name was Hans. One suggestion is that they were daughters of Captain Hans Strang (died 1609), in the service of Dhovfanan 1581-1583 and 1584-1598 in Upland, but ther
2 CONC e is no supporting evidence. ________
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Strang nämns flertalet gånger i Stockholm stads tänkeböcker från 1576 till 1617. Namnet stavas omväxlande Strang, Stranghe och Strång. 
