2 CONT * ^ [ a b c d ] Elgenstierna Gustaf, ed. (1925). The introduced Swedish nobility genealogical tables 1 Abrahamsson-Celsing . Stockholm: Norstedt. p. 151. Libris 10076137
2 CONT
