1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Svante Gustaf (son of Svante John, Tab. 10) born 1796-03-31 Tulle Inge. Student at Uppsala in 1806 and in Lund 1807-09-27. Rust Master the Uppland regiment 1814-01-16. Second Lieutenant in the Army 1814-04-22. Seco
2 CONC nd Lieutenant in the regiment 1815-01-24. Lieutenant in the regiment. Farewell 1820-05-09. Death 1850-12-22 on tulle Inge [Bu]. Married at Tulle Inge 1: o 1820-03-14 with Carolina Ulrika Edman, born 1791-05-10 Bollsta, died 1824-0
2 CONC 2-05 in Tulle Inge, daughter of the auditor Anders Edman and Brita Charlotta Pauli . Married 2: o 1826-10-05 with Beata Mobeck, born 1791-01-05, died 1862-06-28 in Västervik, daughter of the minister in Locknevi and Black Urban pa
2 CONC rishes of the diocese of Linköping Nils Mobeck and his first wife Charlotta Margareta Bergengren.
2 CONT
