1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Heijltje Cornelisdr de Witt''' was born between circa 1506 and circa 1520. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-60566210 Kornelius de Witt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-77516131 Beatrix Pietersdr van Slingeland].
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT Heijltje married [https://www.geni.com/profile-16240998 Ingen Oibertsz]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-16240946 Byateris Ingens]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died before November 1576. 
