1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT He was captiain in the Swedish Army, and joined the battle with Poltana in Ukraine 1709.  He was wounded in the forehead and also in the arm, he was taken prisoner and was taken to Sibiria.  He did not come home until the end of t
2 CONC he war ( about 1721). After he died there was a legal proceedings, his wife and the non-commissioned office Carl B. Adelberg was suspected to have poisoned him.
