2 CONT
2 CONT * Karl Axel Karlsson Leijonhufvud till Ekeberg, [http://books.google.com/books?id=C58uAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA142&lpg=PA142&dq=sven+eketra&source=bl&ots=Itu1xsPmx_&sig=z-ZepbpL7rQ2TWBpyhng7mP4QiM&hl=en&sa=X&ei=OpW8UbLGI7DKyQHk2YDYBA&ved=0CH
