1 NAME Zacharias /Rosbach/
2 GIVN Zacharias
2 _MARNM Rosbach
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1645
2 PLAC Estimated 
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 JUN 1701
