1 NAME Salomon /Cronhielm/
2 GIVN Salomon
2 SURN Cronhielm
2 _MARNM Cronhielm af Hakunge
1 NAME //
2 GIVN
2 SURN
1 NAME //
2 GIVN
2 SURN
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1666
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Altuna
3 CITY Enköping
3 CTRY Sweden
