2 GIVN William
2 SURN Sinclair
2 _MARNM Sinclair
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Tyska Christinae kyrka
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gothenburg
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1655
2 ADDR
3 CITY Gothenburg
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 FEB 1715
