2 CONT * Syskon:	Margareta Christina Gyllensvärd (born Påhlman), Maria Magdalena Gyllenhammar (born Påhlman), Hedvig Ulrika Ladau (born Påhlman), Anders Otto Påhlman, Johan Magnus Påhlman, Adolf Fredrik Påhlman
2 CONT * Make:	Carl Amund Branting
2 CONT * Barn:	Johan Gustaf Branting Og, Anders Gabriel Carlsson Branting, Gustav, Adolf Branting, Emerentia Paulina Branting, Gustava, Ulrika Branting, Kristina Elisabet Branting, Hanna Catharina Carsdotter Branting
