2 CONT === Possible death locations ===
2 CONT Some have noted Shawangunk as her death place; others, Kingston.  Both are in Ulster County, about 27 miles apart.  Kingston is the county seat.  The discrepancy could be a matter of where the records were kept.  I'm just noting b
2 CONC oth locations.
2 CONT
