1 CONT is the provence of birth, then the address is Tuna parish, Kalmar county.
1 CONT 4- 1996: This report had the birthplace as Stralsnas, Asbo, Ostergotland,
1 CONT Sweden. This will have to be verified at another time. Also this report
1 CONT listed her death as 27 Mar 1738.
