1 CONT family locality names use Tuna, Kalmar, as the parish and county. I am
1 CONT going to change the marriage place for this person.
1 CONT 5- The Swedish postal micro-fische has the location  of Sjoarp as a "gard"
1 CONT (farm) in 3 different parishs. Vastra-Ryd,Ostergotland; Brackne-Hoby,
1 CONT Blekinge, and Eksjo, Jonkoping.
1 CONT 6- October 1994: The Swedish Postal Address book has the place nace of
1 CONT "Hokefore" listed as "Hokfore", with 2 dots over the 1st o. If Smaland
1 CONT is the provence of birth them the address is Tuna parish, Kalmar county.
1 CONT 7- There was some additional information from this submition.
