1 CONT 1- The guess location for the marriage of this couple is, "of Oknebult,
1 CONT Ostergotland, Sweden". This need to be verified.
1 CONT 2- 1994: In checking the Swedish Postal book I find that there is a place
1 CONT named "Okne", but not with "bult" attached to it. It is in Kinstrad parish
1 CONT Ostergotland. This could very well be thet proper name for Sara's
1 CONT birthplace. I will put Kinstrand parish in her birth locality.
1 CONT 3- The name of Sara Sophia Meurling was submitted to the temple for ordinance
1 CONT work in 1994, but as a male name. It was re-submitted properly March 1995.
